  "body": "Do-Up and Live In or Invest\r\n\r\nOutstanding opportunity in the prized Rangitoto College zone — this solid three-bedroom home offers incredible value, perfectly suited for first-home buyers, growing families, or astute investors.\r\n\r\nSun-drenched and peacefully positioned, the home presents a comfortable, practical layout: three good-sized bedrooms, one bathroom, and a welcoming living area — ready for light renovations to make it uniquely yours. Add your personal touch and create a wonderful family haven, or secure a high-demand asset in one of Auckland’s most sought-after suburbs.\r\n\r\nStep out to an enormous backyard — the ultimate space for family gatherings, summer BBQs, and plenty of room for children and pets to play freely. Enjoy the very best of Murrays Bay living: the beach is close by, and a great selection of shops, cafés and restaurants are within easy walking distance, making everyday life effortless and\r\nenjoyable.\r\n\r\nOur vendors are genuinely upsizing their home and are highly motivated to sell — this is a sincere, realistic sale, presenting a rare chance to enter this prime location at an accessible price.\r\n\r\nProperty Features;\r\n\r\n• School Zoning: Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Primary & Murrays Bay Intermediate — proven capital growth & strong rental demand\r\n• Layout: 3 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, open living area — solid foundations, ready for light updates\r\n• Sun & Quiet: All-day sunshine, peaceful residential setting\r\n• Massive Backyard: Ideal for entertaining, BBQs, kids and pets — abundant space to grow\r\n• Lifestyle Location: Close to the beach; shops, cafés & restaurants within walking distance\r\n• Parking: 2–3 cars in front of house+ many off street parking\r\n• Convenience: Minutes to Albany Westfield, supermarkets, motorway links & parks\r\n• Dual Appeal: Perfect for owner-occupiers or investors — live in it, refresh it, or hold it\r\n• Motivated Vendors: Genuine upsize move — priced for quick action\r\n\r\nAffordable entry into the Rangi zone does not come along often. This is your chance to secure a property with endless potential in a location everyone desires. Contact us for more information or viewing.",
